5. DATA + PRIVACY
-----------------

The Software runs entirely on the User's machine and makes no network
calls of any kind in normal operation. No build artifacts (ELF, MAP,
linker scripts), analysis reports, file paths, symbol names, or any
other content from the User's environment is transmitted by the
Software to the Licensor or to any third party.

Optional telemetry, if explicitly enabled by the User in
`memscope.toml`, is described in `docs/public/privacy.md`. Telemetry
is OFF by default; when enabled, the User specifies the recipient
endpoint, and the Licensor neither receives nor stores telemetry data.


